  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "<b>Answer:</b> sphere 2 and sphere 4 were outside the range.\n\u2022 Sphere 2 was 12: darker than man-made black (32).\n\u2022 Sphere 4 was 255: brighter than snow (243).\n\u2022 Sphere 1 (230) and sphere 3 (128) were inside it."
